		only available where they can operate legally. By using Stockpile, you confirm that:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>you are located in a jurisdiction where using self-custodial wallets and swapping digital assets is permitted;</li>
		<li>you are not subject to sanctions and are not listed on any sanctions list, such as OFAC's SDN List;</li>
		<li>you meet the eligibility rules of each token issuer whose products you buy; and</li>
		<li>you will follow all laws that apply to your digital asset transactions.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		<strong>Restricted jurisdictions.</strong> The Service is not available to persons or entities located in, incorporated in, or
		resident in any country or region under comprehensive sanctions by the U.S. Department of the Treasury's Office of Foreign
		Assets Control (OFAC), the United Kingdom, the European Union, or the United Nations. These currently include:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Cuba</li>
		<li>Iran</li>
		<li>North Korea (Democratic People's Republic of Korea)</li>
		<li>Syria</li>
		<li>the Crimea, Donetsk, and Luhansk regions of Ukraine</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		<strong>Issuer restrictions.</strong> Each token issuer sets its own eligibility rules, which may be stricter than ours:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>xStocks</strong> are issued by Backed Assets and are not offered to U.S. persons or to residents of certain other
