		<li>blockchain transactions are irreversible, and assets sent to the wrong address cannot be recovered;</li>
		<li>smart contracts, protocols, wallets, and networks can have bugs, be exploited, or suffer outages;</li>
		<li>regulatory changes may restrict or end access to the Service or to specific tokens; and</li>
		<li>technical issues may delay or stop transactions, quotes, or balance updates.</li>
